# Two low pulses on channel 0: samples 2000..2099 and 4200..4299.
# Pulse 1 ends with a change in word 525, so last_change = 2104. At the period
# boundary 4096 the line has been quiet exactly 4096 - 2104 = 1992 samples.
# With gap 1992 that is enough: the first burst ends at the boundary and the
# second pulse opens a new burst. This case fails if the gap test is off by
# one towards "longer" (quiet > gap, or quiet >= gap + 1).
sample two_bursts.sr
samples 8192
period_words 256
pre 100
post 200
gap 1992
burst 1900 2000 2304
burst 4100 4200 4504
